{"5127520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CRAGGFALL", "steam_appid": 5127520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.poster.avif?t=1787846310\" aria-label=\"Craggfall\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.webm?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.mp4?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rock! Craggfall is a physics-driven action and exploration game where you roll, leap, and crash a living rock through uncharted terrain. You feel every bounce, every slope, every surface—as you navigate beautiful, dynamic landscapes. Read the terrain, build speed, and turn slopes, ramps, and ravines into one unbroken line from summit to valley floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER MYSTERIES OF THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth crystals to awaken dormant powers, and unlock new rock forms — each with its own mass, shape, and gloriously different physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.poster.avif?t=1787846310\" aria-label=\"Canyon sunset\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.webm?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.mp4?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE NOT ALONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has noticed you, and it is not happy. Engage enemy forces with physics combat, bashing into creatures, or heaving projectiles from long-range. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS A HIGHLIGHT REEL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craggfall is always recording. Rewind any run, fly a free camera through your best line (or your funniest disaster), and capture the moment. Your greatest trick is never lost — it's one button away.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLANNED FEATURES FOR LAUNCH:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, dynamic biomes to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock forms - each with its own mass, shape, and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power ups &amp; collectibles to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director mode for creating cinematic replays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expansive arsenal of combat weapons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM A STUDIO OF TWO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a two-person team building the game we want to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play: something tactile, mysterious, and honest about what a physics sandbox can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >be. The game is deep in development — a public demo is on the way, the roadmap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is taking shape, and the release date will come when the game has earned it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Craggfall to roll with us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.poster.avif?t=1787846310\" aria-label=\"Craggfall\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.webm?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/3b4c270699097f8499f26d4fc2276800.mp4?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a rock! Craggfall is a physics-driven action and exploration game where you roll, leap, and crash a living rock through uncharted terrain. You feel every bounce, every slope, every surface—as you navigate beautiful, dynamic landscapes. Read the terrain, build speed, and turn slopes, ramps, and ravines into one unbroken line from summit to valley floor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER MYSTERIES OF THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth crystals to awaken dormant powers, and unlock new rock forms — each with its own mass, shape, and gloriously different physics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.poster.avif?t=1787846310\" aria-label=\"Canyon sunset\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.webm?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5127520/extras/ce44ac6b9250baacee3fa9e33a83c715.mp4?t=1787846310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vi